{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_strong_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_strong_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "將錯就錯",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_strong_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f61b32d46e3779a62808bb379ab9ca9148745cafe738625faace112a23465674",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "就是他？你確定沒認錯？這可不是鬧著玩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "盯了有一陣了，和傳出來的消息一模一樣，絕對錯不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘶......看起來的確不太好惹的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怎麼辦，真要動手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "丟的這批貨至關重要，由不得我們選......暗號是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我記得，是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "喲，生意挺好啊，大過年的也不休息？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "趁晚上人多，正好多做點生意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "小姐，您的麻辣鱗丸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "哇，聞著就好香，老闆，給你錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "唔唔......真不錯，不愧是在百大民間美食攻略裡特別推薦的鱗丸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "咦？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "怎......怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "錢給多了，喏，找您錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "謝......謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "我......我可以走了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "啊，還有事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "text": "沒、沒事！老闆再見！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "好像又嚇到客人了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我說錯什麼了嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "呵呵，這幾天好像都是你在出攤啊，老董他人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "最近天冷，董阿伯腿痛，我多幫幫他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "大爺，您認識董阿伯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "龍門最好的鱗丸師傅，我當然認識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "正巧路過，就照顧一下他的生意吧，給我來一份，也讓我嘗嘗你學到了他幾分手藝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "好的，您稍等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "四份鱗丸，三個咖哩，一個菌湯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "好，您稍等，我做完前面這份就做您的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "咳咳，我說四份鱗丸，三個咖哩，一個菌湯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "嗯，我記清楚了，三個咖哩，一個菌湯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（怎麼回事？！你不是說這是暗號嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（沒錯啊！那個菲林女殺手每次和他接頭都說這個！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "大爺，您的鱗丸好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "好，給你錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "不用了大爺，您是董阿伯的熟人，不好意思收您的錢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "那可不行，該給的錢得給，該辦的事也得辦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你說對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（怎麼回事，那個老頭好像在看我們？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（嘖，真麻煩。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這位老闆......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "您的鱗丸還要嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "我......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "您要是不確定要什麼口味的，我給您挑兩個，您先嘗嘗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "你怎麼這就動手了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "不趁這個時候偷襲，等著他幹掉我們嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "少廢話！趕快把人帶走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "這就給滷水幫送信，說他們老大在我們手裡，今晚就得拿東西來換！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "喂，年輕人，下手要有輕重，別壞了龍門的規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "老頭，這是道上的事，一般人躲遠點，別多管閒事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "頭好痛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這是怎麼回事......？這是哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "喲，你醒了。先喝杯水吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "謝——怎麼回事，你們是誰......我怎麼被綁起來了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "對您這樣的大人物，用這種手段也是迫不得已。之前一直不知道滷水幫是您的人，多有得罪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "但是話說回來，這次搶我們的貨到底是滷水幫不對在先。您看，是不是該給個說法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "什麼貨？鱗？那漁船就在碼頭，最新鮮的鱗當然是誰去得早歸誰，怎麼就成我搶你們的了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（他說“碼頭”？我們的貨不就是在碼頭被劫的？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（懂了，“鱗”是黑話，他意思是說，貨被誰拿到就該歸誰。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "咳咳......行，您說的也不是沒有道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "但幹這行也有這行的規矩，這批貨的生意一直是我們叉燒幫在做，您突然要加進來，是不是該先和我們有個商量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我開水產攤這麼久了，怎麼從來沒見過你們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（“水產攤”也是黑話？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（他意思是說，他混得比我們早，我們才是後來的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "......是，我們當然知道，您在整個龍門也是有頭有臉的人物。我們敬重您的地位，所以才和您商量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "您要想做生意，我們可以談，但是您搶去的那批貨，對我們叉燒幫也很重要，大家和氣生財，您就把東西還給我們吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "在龍門......有頭有臉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "那個......你們好像是找錯人了，能不能放我走啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "喂，別敬酒不吃吃罰酒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "我們看在你的面子上和你好好說話。你也別以為我們叉燒幫是好糊弄的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我實在不知道你們在說什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "還在這裝傻？呵，把東西拿出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "這張照片，您還有印象吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這是，槐琥小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "別以為我們不知道，這是你們滷水幫的職業殺手，也是暗中保護你的護衛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "什......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "上個月月底那天，她來你這買了鱗丸，第二天，滷水幫的對頭就被人抄了家，說是一個使古怪功夫的菲林幹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "你還說她不是受你的指使？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "槐琥小姐，怎麼偏偏在那個時候去行俠仗義......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "還有這張呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "近衛局的鬼姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "看來不只是我們，近衛局的人也早就盯上了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "我們的人可不止一次在那家鱗丸攤附近看到過鬼姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "你倒是解釋解釋，近衛局特別任務組的督察，為什麼會對一個賣鱗丸的小販感興趣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "那也是個誤會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "哼，別以為滷水幫替身的把戲能瞞過我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "承認吧，你們滷水幫明面上的老大不過是個傀儡，真正的老大，是你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（我還是先別說話了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "不說話，看來是沒的談了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "好啊，不談也罷，那就看您手下的人，到底要不要管他們的老大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與此同時"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "二哥，終於有老大消息了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "什麼情況？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "叉燒幫剛送信過來，說頭兒在他們手裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "給了我們一個地址，讓我們今晚帶貨物去換人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "他媽的，果然是他們！把大夥都叫上，找叉燒幫算帳去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那我們要帶貨物嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "帶個屁！當我們滷水幫好欺負？抄傢伙！和他們拼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "考慮得怎麼樣，“老大”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "信已經送到了你們滷水幫手裡。現在交出貨物，我們還能和平解決，等一會兒打起來撕破臉，可就不太好收場了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你們怎麼還送了信過去，萬一對面真的派人過來可怎麼辦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "好傢伙，事到如今還敢威脅我們？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我不是這個意思——唉，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（怎麼辦，他說的好像也有道理。萬一打起來，我們人手確實不夠啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（你怎麼不多帶點人來？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（不是你說這次要秘密行動的？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（誰能想到他真的什麼都不說？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（......罷了，你先看好他，最好能逼他把東西交出來。我去多叫幾個兄弟來。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "考慮得怎麼樣，“老大”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "識相點，現在交出貨物，我們和平解決，一會兒要是打起來撕破臉，可就真的不好收場了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "能問問，你們說的“貨”，到底是什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "還要裝傻？你們滷水幫的人在碼頭打傷我們好幾個兄弟，就為了搶這個東西，能不知道這東西的分量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "呵，這麼危險的生意也就你們滷水幫敢和我們叉燒幫搶了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你說，“危險”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "別裝了，誰不知道這東西有多危險？敢在近衛局眼皮底下和我們搶這生意，不就是想賺筆大的嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......那個，現在就剩你一個人了對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "哎，好吧，我告訴你東西到底藏在哪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "哦？這還差不多。快說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你靠過來點，我悄悄告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "好了，你說吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "再過來點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "拖拖拉拉的，真是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "董阿伯說得對，用腦袋撞人有時候比拳頭還管用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這繩子綁得真緊......不好意思，這把刀先借我用用，有機會再還你吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "雖然不知道你們到底要找誰又要找什麼東西，可是你們真的找錯人了，我真的不是什麼老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "唉，說了你們也不聽，我還是先走吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "嗚，頭好痛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "按信上寫的，就是這了。叉燒幫的人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看那邊，有一個拿著刀的人從樓裡走出來了，應該就是叉燒幫接頭的人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等一下，你們看那個人，是不是有些面熟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我想起來了！他就是那個偽裝成水產販子的頂級殺手。我上次親眼見他用一把刮鱗刀砍翻了二十個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "沒想到他居然是叉燒幫的人，這下可不好辦了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "先別急，過去問問再說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "沒人追出來，應該甩掉了吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "唉......大過年的，攤都沒收呢，這都是什麼事啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，那邊那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "啊，叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這裡是叉燒幫的地盤嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（剛那幾個人，說他們是叉燒幫的來著。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "啊對，這就是叉燒幫的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇惡的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "抓住他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇惡的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我們老大在哪？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我哪知道？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇惡的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "呵，知道你們叉燒幫人多，但別以為我們滷水幫就好欺負！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你們找錯人了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "竟然一下子就把二哥打倒了，不愧是叉燒幫第一殺手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "怎麼還有這個版本......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "別怕！我們這麼多人，壓都能壓死他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "大家跟我上，救出老大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這......現在還是先跑路比較好吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "別讓他跑了！追！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "好啊，還真帶著人過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "兄弟們，和他們拼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "呵，原來還有埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "兄弟們別怕，跟他們拼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "交出東西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "交出我們老大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "唉，你們怎麼打起來了？大家有話好好說，別打架啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這，唉......我還是先回去收攤吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "可是，他們說的“貨”，到底是什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "王阿伯，晚上好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "哎，這不是孑小子嗎。你怎麼來了，這個時間可沒新鮮的鱗賣你啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "不是，阿伯，我想向您打聽點事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "就在最近，您有見過兩夥人在碼頭打架嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "別開玩笑了，就在這碼頭，一天到晚打架的人比買鱗的人還多，你問的是哪一次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "不是一般的路人打架，是那種，一看就是很壞的兩夥人打架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "哎，這麼說也不對......阿伯，最近您在碼頭上見過什麼生面孔嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "嗐，這麼大的碼頭，每天人來人往的，我哪能記得清？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "......欸，不過你這麼一說，我好像有點印象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "我記得上個月有一陣子，每天傍晚的時候都有人運一批箱子到碼頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "要是一般送貨的人我也不會在意，但是那批箱子都用黑色的布裹得嚴嚴實實，看起來還蠻奇怪的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "您還記得那些人的長相嗎？那些箱子都送到哪去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "那時候我正忙著收攤呢，哪有功夫記這個。你當誰都像你小子一樣，記性那麼好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（看來叉燒幫說的就是這批貨物。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（他們到底在謀劃什麼......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "哎喲，剛都沒注意，看你臉上這傷，又打架了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "接著，拿冰塊敷一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "你這孩子，明明看著挺老實，怎麼總見你身上掛著傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這......其實我也不想的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "這麼些年了，我也算了解你小子。心眼好，性子又直，見不得半點不公道。所以才總是和那些混混起衝突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "不是阿伯，那些其實都是誤會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王阿伯",
      "text": "我知道你是個好孩子，但你也要保護好自己。出了事自然有該管事的人，不該惹的人你千萬不要惹，明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝您阿伯。但今晚我有必須要做的事，而且我想我知道該怎麼做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "對了阿伯，能借您電話一用嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "該死的叉燒幫，還挺能打......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "其他人也真是......怎麼都跑得那麼快。都跑哪去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "還好，看起來剩了一個沒跑掉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "是......是你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "對，是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "叉燒幫第一殺手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "噫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "饒命......饒命！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "剛才的事我姑且不和你計較。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "但你仔細聽好了，接下來的問題，我只問一遍，如果回答不能讓我滿意——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你知道會是什麼下場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我說！只要我知道的，我一定說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "上周，滷水幫從我們這搶去的東西，現在放在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "滷水幫搶我們的東西是有什麼打算？準備賣給誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "還說不知道？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我真的不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "我、我入夥還不到兩個月......幫裡的那些機密，我真的是一點都不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "那你知道些什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "就在上周！在碼頭，幫裡派人搶了叉燒幫的什麼東西，老大很高興。但是沒過幾天，老大就失蹤了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "幫裡派了好多人去找，但怎麼都找不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（原來滷水幫的老大是真的失蹤了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "然後呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "然後，然後直到今天，聽說收到叉燒幫的信，我只是以為要打架了，才跟著其他人來的，別的什麼我是真的不知道了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（嗯......好像確實問不出什麼東西了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "咳，告訴你，你們老大就在我們叉燒幫手裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "去告訴你們老大，不對......告訴你們幫裡現在能管事的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "再給你們一次和談的機會，今晚零點，帶著從我們叉燒幫搶的東西，在碼頭等我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這次要是再看不到你們滷水幫的誠意，我們就真的要撕票了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "滾吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的滷水幫成員",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "看樣子，他應該是相信了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "演壞人，好難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "冷靜，冷靜......接下來是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "廢物！飯桶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "抓住的人還能讓他給跑了，人丟了，我們拿什麼和滷水幫談判？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "你還罵我？你帶那麼多人不也沒逮住他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "聽說有人要找我，我來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫眾人",
      "text": "是你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呵，該誇你們觀察力不錯，竟然能發現我的真實身份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "沒錯，我就是滷水幫的老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "果然......你、你想怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "很簡單，滷水幫搶叉燒幫的東西，我會如數歸還。但叉燒幫綁架我這件事，我也要一個說法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "今晚零點，滷水幫會帶著東西在碼頭等著你們。同樣的，我要叉燒幫上下所有人全部到場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "該還的東西我會還，可丟掉的面子，我也會找回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（怎麼辦，這東西我們還敢要嗎......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "（等、等等......他只有一個人，剛才能打暈他一次，說不定......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "我看誰敢妄動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "她......她就是那個菲林女殺手！真的是她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呵，剛才我大意被你們偷襲得逞了一回，你們還有膽子幹第二次？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "看起來，你們是真的不清楚，你們到底是在和什麼人打交道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "（接下來該幹嘛了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "（牆，牆！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "（哦對。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "一拳就......把牆打穿了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "兩小時後，我在碼頭等著你們。要是見不到叉燒幫的人，後果自負！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "現在該怎麼辦......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的叉燒幫成員",
      "text": "還能怎麼辦，該來的躲不了，我們去就是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "等等等等，跑這麼快幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你還沒告訴我呢，為什麼專門叫我來陪你演這齣戲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呼......到這裡應該差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "唉，說實話，其實到現在我也不完全清楚到底是怎麼一回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "總之先謝謝你了，下次請你吃鱗丸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "不客氣，倒也沒什麼大不了的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "不過你剛才還真挺像一個老大的，看得我都差點信了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "我看上去就那麼像壞人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你不會真的有什麼秘密身份吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "你就別調侃我了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "哎，我還是先去碼頭吧，等到零點，應該一切都清楚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫",
      "text": "不錯，來得挺準時啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "滷水幫",
      "text": "呵，你們也不差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫",
      "text": "我們要的東西呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "滷水幫",
      "text": "先別急著問貨，我們老大在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫",
      "text": "開什麼玩笑，你們滷水幫還想耍我們到什麼時候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫",
      "text": "廢話少說，快把搶我們的東西交出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "滷水幫",
      "text": "做夢，先讓我們見到老大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫",
      "text": "簡直是欺人太甚，你們還想打一架？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "滷水幫",
      "text": "要打便打，還怕你們不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎哎，都先把傢伙放下。有什麼話去局裡慢慢說吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叉燒幫&滷水幫",
      "text": "他媽的，上當了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "所有人，跟我走一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "就是你報的警吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "對，是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "能不能說說，你是怎麼知道這兩夥人今晚在碼頭有交易的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這個，解釋起來，好複雜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "還有好多事情我到現在也沒弄明白，但大概情況就是這樣......您能相信嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈哈，不用緊張，其實這件案子，近衛局也跟了一段時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "告訴你也無妨。其實在之前那場動亂後，好多武器遺落在龍門街頭。近衛局已經盡力回收了，但還是有不少被叉燒幫這些人撿去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這、這豈不是很危險？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗯，不過這些人倒也沒直接走私武器的膽子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他們打算把這些武器上還完好的源石裝置拆卸下來再賣到其他地方去。當然這種事也是違法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "前幾天，近衛局抓住了滷水幫的頭目，當時他正在給那批從叉燒幫手裡搶來的貨物找下家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那傢伙嘴還挺嚴，我們沒問出多少東西。今晚能將這些人一網打盡，你功不可沒。也真虧你能有這個主意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但話說回來，下次可不許再幹這麼危險的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "原來是這樣，我總算是明白了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "警官，要是沒什麼事，我能走了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "稍等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "實不相瞞，我也關注你好久了。我覺得憑你的本事，只在龍門當一個小攤商販實在是有些屈才了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我知道有份更適合你的差事，你要不要考慮一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "這......謝謝您的好意，警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "可是，龍門需要您這樣的警官，也需要水產販子，沒什麼屈不屈才的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "哎，我嘴笨，總之，我覺得現在沒什麼不好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，我明白。行，我當然尊重你的選擇。不過要是什麼時候改了主意，隨時可以來找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "辛苦您了，那我就先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "欸，等近衛局年假放完記得來領獎狀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "啊，有空一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "好小子，不愧是跟著姓董的出來的，我也算沒看錯人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎，看到那個鱗丸攤了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看起來生意不錯啊，要不去嘗嘗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嚯，你別以為那只是個普通鱗丸攤，攤主的真實身份，是龍門碼頭總舵主！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "大年夜那天，他一人約戰叉燒幫滷水幫兩個幫派共兩百多人，你猜怎麼樣，他一個人把兩百多人全都打趴下了！而且啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "噓！小點聲，他好像聽見了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "老闆，要來份鱗丸嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
